#! solo --size 100x34 --faux scripts/proof/tui_see/question.jsonl
# A root asks a design question; the person picks option 2 by key and the model goes on.
wait-frame 5000 faux-1
tick 1
type lay out the plan pane
key enter
wait-frame 30000 Which layout for the plan pane?
snap card
key down
snap preview
key 2
wait-frame 30000 Composing
tick 8000
wait-idle 30000
snap answered
quit
